PRANA Online 2.0 is the new official PRANA app for remote control of the recuperator from smartphones.
Leave inconvenient remote controls and dead batteries in the past! With the new PRANA Online 2.0 mobile application, you can easily control your recuperator using your own smartphone.
The intuitive interface and modern design of the application provide simple and convenient control of the ventilation system. The device is connected to the network via Bluetooth or Wi-Fi.
The application allows you to remotely turn the device on and off, switch the recuperator's operating modes, adjust the display brightness, date and time. It also allows you to enable/disable the functions "Winter mode", "Mini heating", etc.
Among the many advantages of the new smart app: 
- A simple, intuitive modern interface;
- Constant updating and improvement of the program;
- Safe and fast access to the recuperator;
- Online monitoring of air quality, generation of statistics for the selected period (for premium recuperators);
- Convenient settings, the ability to independently set the required operating mode according to your needs;
- Ability to control multiple devices from one smartphone.
How do I install the application for convenient PRANA 2.0 management?
1. Install and turn on the PRANA recuperator;
2. Download the PRANA Online 2.0 application to your smartphone;
3. Turn on Bluetooth on the smartphone, wait for the icon to appear at the top of the screen;
4. Provide access to geodata (for the first use);
5. Enable the system search for "Bluetooth";
6. Open the PRANA Online application and create an account;
7. Confirm registration on the registration page in the browser;
8. Receive confirmation within 10 minutes.
9. Open the PRANA Online 2.0 program and enjoy all the benefits of intelligent recuperator control.
PRANA is the author and manufacturer of innovative ventilation systems with heat recovery technology that retain up to 98% of heat and coolness in the room. PRANA recuperators provide high-quality air exchange at facilities for any purpose: in apartments, houses, offices, educational and training centers, shopping and entertainment centers, and sports facilities.
Install the PRANA Online 2.0 mobile application on your smartphone and enjoy fresh air 24 hours a day!
